</ul>
<blockquote>"Accurate, verified reporting remains vital for public awareness," noted the 9jaBeacon Editorial Desk.</blockquote>', 'cat_money_hustle', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Central%20Bank%20of%20Nigeria%20architectural%20facade%2C%20modern%20skyscraper%20finance%20district%20in%20Lagos%2C%20stacks%20of%20Nigerian%20Naira%20notes%2C%20stock%20market%20graph%2C%20high-end%20financial%20still%20life%2C%20conceptual%20editorial%20photography%2C%20studio%20lighting%2C%20highly%20detailed%2C%20NO%20human%20beings%2C%20NO%20faces%2C%20NO%20text?width=1200&height=675&nologo=true&model=flux', 'Symbolic editorial concept: Mutfwang Moves To Strengthen Plateau’s State Police Framework.', '9jaBeacon Editorial AI Desk (Flux Engine)', 'Broadcast journalism desk with breaking national coverage.', '9jaBeacon Finance Team', 'Markets, Banking & Economy Desk', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 4, 'src_channels_tv', 'Channels Television', 'https://www.channelstv.com/2026/09/10/mutfwang-moves-to-strengthen-plateaus-state-police-framework/', '2026-09-10T08:45:23.057Z', '2026-09-10T08:45:23.057Z', '2026-09-10 08:45:23', 'published');
