<p>Cross River State Governor Bassey Otu has ordered the cancellation of thousands of unauthorised appointments into the local government service by the Local Government Service Commission which was sacked earlier in the year.</p>
<p>A statement by the Secretary to State Government, Professor Anthony Owan Eno, on Wednesday evening said the recruitments carried out by the sacked commission were unauthorised, illegal and not in compliance with the state&#8217;s civil service rules.</p>
<h3>The Stakes</h3>
<p>This development is poised to impact governance, citizens, and relevant market sectors across Nigeria.</p>
