<p>The Sokoto State Police Command has issued a warning to political parties and their supporters regarding the necessity of refraining from violence, hate speech, misinformation, and any other actions that may jeopardise the peaceful execution of the 2027 general elections.</p>
<p>He said the meeting was aimed at formalising a framework for peaceful political campaigns, stressing that elections should be a contest of ideas and not a war to be won through force.</p>
